    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116890/extras/fd08c3abb0ad2d9178547adb370a0641.avif?t=1749543396\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game description</h2><strong>Background of the game:</strong><br>The little sisters seem to have a very important date, but unfortunately the road to the appointment is still not smooth, now they need your help more than ever to cross the obstacles, quickly use the flexibility to jump or climb to reach the appointment!<br>The girls will definitely thank you~\u2764<br><strong>Gameplay introduction:</strong><br>Players need to control the character by jumping or climbing, to achieve a variety of obstacles across the terrain or avoid and cross the trap, to reach the final target point to win.<br><strong>Game features:</strong><br>In the game, you will experience.<br>- 11 beautiful CG<br>- Brand new animation vertical drawing<br>- A unique world view<br>- A variety of interactive gameplay<br>- Challenging levels (guaranteed not to make things difficult for you)<br>- One click to skip<br>Little sisters do not like toys and puppies, so they sadly left the place (this work will not appear to help him content), but this has not been quiet for a few days, a new group of cute and interesting girls moved in, immediately became lively again, they also quickly get along to become good friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Character List</h2>Character: Rabbit<br>Setting: Cute and meta, with the nature of a rabbit<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116890/extras/rabbit.png?t=1749543396\" /></div><br>Character: Cow<br>Setting: Dull and cute, as if always asleep<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116890/extras/cow.png?t=1749543396\" /></div><br>Character: Sheep<br>Setting: Looks soft and fluffy, but I hear she always seems to be getting into trouble<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116890/extras/sheep.png?t=1749543396\" /></div><br>Character: Snake<br>Setting: A gentle, caring big sister who you can talk to about any troubles<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116890/extras/snake.png?t=1749543396\" /></div><br>Character: Mouse<br>Setting: Short and small girl, but not very forgiving on the mouth<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116890/extras/mouse.png?t=1749543396\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Us</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2116890/extras/4dc965c05a968f95fbd49075b4c5eee6.avif?t=1749543396\" /></div><br>Hello, we are Lovely Game, desire, throbbing, we are eager to give you the purest romance.<br>Because we want to provide you with a more convenient gaming experience, we have now launched the official Lovely Games website, so you can get our latest information anytime, anywhere, and if you encounter any problems in the game, you can also choose to raise them in the community F&amp;Q discussion or the official steam group~.<br>Thanks for the love.",
